│  baselines, while enhancing interpretability and trust.                      │
│    * `toolformer_2023`: Demonstrates that models can autonomously determine  │
│  when and how to invoke external APIs (e.g., question-answering engines,     │
│  calculators) using discrete call tokens to handle specialized computation   │
│  and factual lookup.                                                         │
│    * `wang_2023_survey`: Synthesizes the agent action module as an           │
