│                                                                              │
│  #### Theme 2: Deliberative tree-search planning overcomes the limitations   │
│  of linear autoregressive decoding.                                          │
│  * **Claim:** Replacing greedy left-to-right token generation with           │
│  structured heuristic exploration—featuring lookahead, self-evaluation, and  │
│  backtracking—significantly boosts agent performance on complex              │
│  problem-solving tasks.                                                      │
│  * **Evidence:**                                                             │
│    * `tot_2023`: Introduces the Tree of Thoughts (ToT) paradigm to enable    │
│  language models to explore multiple reasoning paths over thoughts,          │
│  evaluate options, and backtrack, showing that ToT significantly             │
│  outperforms Chain-of-Thought (CoT) and standard Input-Output (IO)           │
│  prompting on challenging benchmarks.                                        │
│    * `wang_2023_survey`: Classifies multi-path reasoning and external        │
│  planning as foundational components required for advanced agent planning    │
